      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأبّر</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a palm-tree, A and Msb, or a young
palm-tree, S) <i>admitted,</i> or <i>received, fecundation:</i>
(S, A, Msb:) <i>it became fecundated of itself.</i> (S.)

